      <section id="english" lang="en">
        <p class="eyebrow">SETUP &amp; SUPPORT</p><h1>Start with a small test.</h1>
        <p>TilJot’s Chinese name is 提腕记; both names refer to the same app. Choose Chinese, English or Follow System in Mac Settings &amp; devices, iPhone Interface language, or Watch ⓘ details. Preferences are saved separately on each device and never translate dictated content. Home-screen and input-method names follow the system language.</p>
        <p>Invitation testing is being prepared. Invited testers can <a href="https://tiljot-beta-downloads.netlify.app/?lang=en" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">download the password-protected Mac kit</a> using username <code>tiljot</code> and the password supplied privately by the developer. iPhone and Watch TestFlight invitations are provided separately; there is no public invitation link. Do not install an old development package or disable macOS security protections.</p>
        <h2>What you need</h2><p>An Apple Silicon Mac, an iPhone and its paired Apple Watch. Installation, model downloads, updates and TestFlight need internet access. After trusted pairing, dictation connects from Watch to Mac over encrypted Bluetooth; all three devices do not have to share the same Wi-Fi.</p>
        <h2>First use</h2><ol>
          <li>Install the supplied Mac package and the iPhone/Watch app through the approved testing channel. Keep the Mac awake, the Watch nearby and Bluetooth enabled.</li>
          <li>In TilJot on Mac, open the first-use guide. Prepare the local recognition model, then add and select the TilJot input method in macOS settings.</li>
          <li>Use the iPhone app to scan the Mac’s pairing code and sync the configuration to Watch. Never share a pairing QR code.</li>
          <li>Open a blank TextEdit document, click the text area and select the TilJot input method. Start recording on Watch and speak one short, non-sensitive sentence in your usual voice.</li>
          <li>Check the final text before using it. Ordinary dictation inserts text, not commands or messages. Optional Codex submission requires explicit enablement, Mac Accessibility permission and your deliberate long press.</li>
        </ol>
        <h2>If something goes wrong</h2><p>If text already appeared, check it on the Mac before repeating the recording. If the Watch submit button is unavailable, verify the current draft and send from the computer if appropriate. Do not repeatedly re-pair, reinstall or disable security protections. Stop optional submission if it sends without your long press, submits to a wrong target or duplicates a message.</p>
        <p>Record the approximate time, which stage was slow, device/system versions and the exact status. You may preview “diagnostic summary (no text)” on Mac and share it after checking it. Do not send passwords, verification codes, pairing codes, private transcripts or other people’s information. Recordings are not required for routine feedback.</p>
        <h2>Limits and recovery</h2><p>Each recording is limited to 75 seconds. Recognition may make mistakes, particularly with whispers, names and mixed speech. Independent Steer and Watch submission to other apps are not yet available. Connection recovery may take time.</p>
        <p>If a Mac installation is interrupted, preserve the error and contact support. Use a recovery package only when it matches that failed installation and after saving your work; it is not a general downgrade or uninstall tool. Models, settings and some credentials can remain after uninstalling. Ask before deleting unfamiliar directories or Keychain entries.</p>
        <p>Contact <a href={`mailto:${contact}`}>{contact}</a> for installation help, feedback or privacy requests. See the <a href="/tiljot/privacy/">TilJot privacy policy</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section id="chinese" lang="zh-CN">
        <p class="eyebrow">设置与支持</p><h1>先做一次小测试。</h1>
        <p>中文名为“提腕记”，英文名为 TilJot，是同一个 App。Mac 的“设置与设备”、iPhone 的“界面语言”和手表的 ⓘ 详情都可选择中文、English 或跟随系统。各设备独立保存界面偏好，不改变听写内容的语言；系统桌面与输入法列表中的名称随系统语言显示。</p>
        <p>目前正在准备邀请内测。受邀测试者可<a href="https://tiljot-beta-downloads.netlify.app/?lang=zh" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">下载受密码保护的 Mac 交付包</a>，用户名为 <code>tiljot</code>，密码由开发者私下提供。手机与手表的 TestFlight 邀请另行提供，尚无公开邀请链接。不安装旧开发包，不关闭 macOS 安全保护。</p>
        <h2>需要的设备</h2><p>Apple Silicon Mac、iPhone 及其已配对的 Apple Watch。安装、模型下载、更新和 TestFlight 需要联网。可信配对完成后，听写通过加密蓝牙从手表直连 Mac，不要求三端在同一个 Wi-Fi。</p>
        <h2>首次使用</h2><ol>
          <li>安装指定 Mac 包，并通过批准的测试渠道安装手机与手表 App。保持 Mac 唤醒、手表在附近、蓝牙开启。</li>
          <li>在 Mac 提腕记打开“首次使用”引导，准备本地识别模型，在系统设置中添加并选择提腕记输入法。</li>
          <li>用手机扫描 Mac 配对码，将配置同步到手表。不要公开配对二维码。</li>
          <li>打开空白 TextEdit 文稿，点入正文并选提腕记输入法。在手表开始录音，用日常音量说一句非敏感短句。</li>
          <li>检查最终文字。普通听写只输入文字，不执行命令或发送消息。可选 Codex 提交需要明确启用、Mac 辅助功能权限，并由你主动长按。</li>
        </ol>
        <h2>出现问题时</h2><p>文字已出现时先在 Mac 核对，不连续重录。手表发送按钮不可用时，确认当前草稿后可在电脑发送。不要反复解除配对、重装或关闭安全保护。若未经长按就发送、错目标或重复发送，请立即停用可选提交功能并反馈。</p>
        <p>记录大致时间、慢在哪一阶段、设备与系统版本、提示原文。可以先预览 Mac 的“诊断摘要（无正文）”，核对后再分享。不要发送密码、验证码、配对码、私人正文或他人资料；日常反馈不要求录音。</p>
        <h2>当前限制与安装恢复</h2><p>单次录音最多75秒。耳语、专名和中英混说可能识别错误；独立 Steer 与其他应用的手表提交暂未提供，连接恢复可能需要等待。</p>
        <p>Mac 安装中断时保留错误并联系支持；仅使用与该失败安装匹配的恢复包，先保存工作。它不是任意降级或卸载工具。卸载后模型、设置和部分凭证可能仍保留；不确定时先询问，不清空陌生目录或钥匙串。</p>
        <p>安装帮助、反馈及隐私请求：<a href={`mailto:${contact}`}>{contact}</a>。另见 <a href="/tiljot/privacy/">提腕记隐私政策</a>。</p>
      </section>
